{"id":"f08305bb0d508a7d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-basic-axioms.md","title":"BASIC Axioms","display":"df-basic-axioms — BASIC Axioms","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-basic-axioms","aliases":["72-df-basic-axioms"],"display":"df-basic-axioms — BASIC Axioms","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]"],"source_author":"Samuel R. Buss","source_chapter":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)","source_sections":"§1.3.3.1","source_printed_pages":"101","source_pdf_pages":"113","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-basic-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-basic-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-basic-axioms — BASIC Axioms"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Samuel R. Buss"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"Samuel R. Buss, Chapter II, Proof Theory of Arithmetic, in Handbook of Proof Theory (1998)"},{"key":"source_sections","html":"§1.3.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"101"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"113"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5635e2f9f2823a2f\" href=\"?note=5635e2f9f2823a2f\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:=v_0,b:=v_1,c:=v_2,d:=v_3\">\\(a:=v_0,b:=v_1,c:=v_2,d:=v_3\\)</span> 是四个固定互异的对象变量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\">\\(t,u\\)</span> 取算术项，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1,2\">\\(1,2\\)</span> 与项的并置乘法在 Assertion 中给出缩写。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}\">\\(\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}\\)</span> 是开放公式的有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BASIC}\">\\(\\mathrm{BASIC}\\)</span> 是其全称闭包集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"1:=S0,\\qquad2:=S(S0),\\qquad tu:=t\\cdot u.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[1:=S0,\\qquad2:=S(S0),\\qquad tu:=t\\cdot u.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}:=\\{&amp;\na\\leq b\\to a\\leq Sb,\\quad a\\ne Sa,\\quad0\\leq a,\\\\\n&amp;(a\\leq b\\land a\\ne b)\\leftrightarrow Sa\\leq b,\\quad a\\ne0\\to2a\\ne0,\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\lor b\\leq a,\\quad a\\leq b\\land b\\leq a\\to a=b,\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\land b\\leq c\\to a\\leq c,\\quad|0|=0,\\quad|S0|=S0,\\\\\n&amp;a\\ne0\\to(|2a|=S(|a|)\\land|S(2a)|=S(|a|)),\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\to|a|\\leq|b|,\\quad|a\\#b|=S(|a|\\cdot|b|),\\quad0\\#a=S0,\\\\\n&amp;a\\ne0\\to(1\\#(2a)=2(1\\#a)\\land1\\#S(2a)=2(1\\#a)),\\\\\n&amp;a\\#b=b\\#a,\\\\\n&amp;|a|=|b|\\to a\\#c=b\\#c,\\\\\n&amp;|a|=|b|+|c|\\to a\\#d=(b\\#d)\\cdot(c\\#d),\\quad a\\leq a+b,\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\land a\\ne b\\to(S(2a)\\leq2b\\land S(2a)\\ne2b),\\\\\n&amp;a+b=b+a,\\quad a+0=a,\\quad a+Sb=S(a+b),\\\\\n&amp;(a+b)+c=a+(b+c),\\quad a+b\\leq a+c\\leftrightarrow b\\leq c,\\\\\n&amp;a\\cdot0=0,\\quad a\\cdot Sb=a\\cdot b+a,\\quad a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a,\\\\\n&amp;a\\cdot(b+c)=a\\cdot b+a\\cdot c,\\\\\n&amp;S0\\leq a\\to(a\\cdot b\\leq a\\cdot c\\leftrightarrow b\\leq c),\\\\\n&amp;a\\ne0\\to|a|=S(|\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor|),\\\\\n&amp;a=\\lfloor b/2\\rfloor\\leftrightarrow(2a=b\\lor S(2a)=b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BASIC}:=&amp;\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A):A\\in\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}:=\\{&amp;\na\\leq b\\to a\\leq Sb,\\quad a\\ne Sa,\\quad0\\leq a,\\\\\n&amp;(a\\leq b\\land a\\ne b)\\leftrightarrow Sa\\leq b,\\quad a\\ne0\\to2a\\ne0,\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\lor b\\leq a,\\quad a\\leq b\\land b\\leq a\\to a=b,\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\land b\\leq c\\to a\\leq c,\\quad|0|=0,\\quad|S0|=S0,\\\\\n&amp;a\\ne0\\to(|2a|=S(|a|)\\land|S(2a)|=S(|a|)),\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\to|a|\\leq|b|,\\quad|a\\#b|=S(|a|\\cdot|b|),\\quad0\\#a=S0,\\\\\n&amp;a\\ne0\\to(1\\#(2a)=2(1\\#a)\\land1\\#S(2a)=2(1\\#a)),\\\\\n&amp;a\\#b=b\\#a,\\\\\n&amp;|a|=|b|\\to a\\#c=b\\#c,\\\\\n&amp;|a|=|b|+|c|\\to a\\#d=(b\\#d)\\cdot(c\\#d),\\quad a\\leq a+b,\\\\\n&amp;a\\leq b\\land a\\ne b\\to(S(2a)\\leq2b\\land S(2a)\\ne2b),\\\\\n&amp;a+b=b+a,\\quad a+0=a,\\quad a+Sb=S(a+b),\\\\\n&amp;(a+b)+c=a+(b+c),\\quad a+b\\leq a+c\\leftrightarrow b\\leq c,\\\\\n&amp;a\\cdot0=0,\\quad a\\cdot Sb=a\\cdot b+a,\\quad a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a,\\\\\n&amp;a\\cdot(b+c)=a\\cdot b+a\\cdot c,\\\\\n&amp;S0\\leq a\\to(a\\cdot b\\leq a\\cdot c\\leftrightarrow b\\leq c),\\\\\n&amp;a\\ne0\\to|a|=S(|\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor|),\\\\\n&amp;a=\\lfloor b/2\\rfloor\\leftrightarrow(2a=b\\lor S(2a)=b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BASIC}:=&amp;\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A):A\\in\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ch. II §1.3.3.1，印刷 p. 101（PDF p. 113）的两栏 32 个 BASIC 公理已用原页图像逐式核对。每一个大合取作为原书的一条公理，计数为 32；没有省略号。</li>\n<li>原子此前把部分 PA 式和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\log,2^x\">\\(\\log,2^x\\)</span> 的标准解释混入 BASIC，且写出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lfloor S(2x+1)/2\\rfloor=x\">\\(\\lfloor S(2x+1)/2\\rfloor=x\\)</span>（在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=0\">\\(x=0\\)</span> 即假）。本修订采用原书有限通用公理，不用标准函数解释替代公理。</li>\n<li>该版本为书中采用的 Buss [1986] BASIC；原书脚注提及其他 BASIC 变体，未据此暗中加上 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|a|\\leq a\">\\(|a|\\leq a\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>已核对来源陈述，并对标准自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\leq a,b,c,d\\leq7\">\\(0\\leq a,b,c,d\\leq7\\)</span> 的各式作有限检查；有限检查不证明任意模型的公理或 bootstrapping 定理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"5635e2f9f2823a2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 及 $\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}$ 取 [[72-df-bounded-arithmetic-language]]；$a:=v_0,b:=v_1,c:=v_2,d:=v_3$ 是四个固定互异的对象变量。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"a:=v_0,b:=v_1,c:=v_2,d:=v_3","display":false},{"tex":"t,u","display":false},{"tex":"1,2","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BASIC}","display":false},{"tex":"1:=S0,\\qquad2:=S(S0),\\qquad tu:=t\\cdot u.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}:=\\{&\na\\leq b\\to a\\leq Sb,\\quad a\\ne Sa,\\quad0\\leq a,\\\\\n&(a\\leq b\\land a\\ne b)\\leftrightarrow Sa\\leq b,\\quad a\\ne0\\to2a\\ne0,\\\\\n&a\\leq b\\lor b\\leq a,\\quad a\\leq b\\land b\\leq a\\to a=b,\\\\\n&a\\leq b\\land b\\leq c\\to a\\leq c,\\quad|0|=0,\\quad|S0|=S0,\\\\\n&a\\ne0\\to(|2a|=S(|a|)\\land|S(2a)|=S(|a|)),\\\\\n&a\\leq b\\to|a|\\leq|b|,\\quad|a\\#b|=S(|a|\\cdot|b|),\\quad0\\#a=S0,\\\\\n&a\\ne0\\to(1\\#(2a)=2(1\\#a)\\land1\\#S(2a)=2(1\\#a)),\\\\\n&a\\#b=b\\#a,\\\\\n&|a|=|b|\\to a\\#c=b\\#c,\\\\\n&|a|=|b|+|c|\\to a\\#d=(b\\#d)\\cdot(c\\#d),\\quad a\\leq a+b,\\\\\n&a\\leq b\\land a\\ne b\\to(S(2a)\\leq2b\\land S(2a)\\ne2b),\\\\\n&a+b=b+a,\\quad a+0=a,\\quad a+Sb=S(a+b),\\\\\n&(a+b)+c=a+(b+c),\\quad a+b\\leq a+c\\leftrightarrow b\\leq c,\\\\\n&a\\cdot0=0,\\quad a\\cdot Sb=a\\cdot b+a,\\quad a\\cdot b=b\\cdot a,\\\\\n&a\\cdot(b+c)=a\\cdot b+a\\cdot c,\\\\\n&S0\\leq a\\to(a\\cdot b\\leq a\\cdot c\\leftrightarrow b\\leq c),\\\\\n&a\\ne0\\to|a|=S(|\\lfloor a/2\\rfloor|),\\\\\n&a=\\lfloor b/2\\rfloor\\leftrightarrow(2a=b\\lor S(2a)=b)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{BASIC}:=&\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\mathrm{BA}}(A):A\\in\\Gamma_{\\mathrm{BASIC}}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\log,2^x","display":false},{"tex":"\\lfloor S(2x+1)/2\\rfloor=x","display":false},{"tex":"x=0","display":false},{"tex":"|a|\\leq a","display":false},{"tex":"0\\leq a,b,c,d\\leq7","display":false}],"bytes":3163,"backlinks":[{"id":"690ac0b5f3b63c49","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathrm{BASIC}$ 取 [[72-df-basic-axioms]]，$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"bde0adecda9b3967","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$i\\in\\omega$；$\\mathrm{BASIC}$ 取 [[72-df-basic-axioms]]，$\\Sigma_i^b$ 取 [[72-df-sigma-bounded-hierarchy]]。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-223","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-basic-axioms|df-basic-axioms — BASIC Axioms]]"}],"outgoing":["5635e2f9f2823a2f"]}